{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_st03","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_st03","title":"粘劫收后","storyCode":"WB-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"1a2ae71231f2a555ed91d271b7104cac19dfa17bdf7e48d88f1d4546df392ced","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"事件终于告一段落，魏彦吾与太傅似乎还有别的隐忧。重岳与城中故人一一告别后离开。在城外大漠上，他听到了城楼上响起的鼓声。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生，怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生说没有大碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是之前受了伤，又那样拼命使用源石技艺，过于劳累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸他毕竟上了年纪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时都忘了，林先生，已经为龙门操劳了这么久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸和魏长官不一样。魏长官是龙门的象征，他必须时时刻刻出现在大众的视野里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是人人都时常记得下城区有一位鼠王，对龙门而言并非一件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了，这次的麻烦事，是魏彦吾卷你进来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我接下了，那就是我自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且多亏了某人，我最终也没出事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也多亏这次机会，让我想明白了一些问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你接下来准备去维多利亚？我们可以同路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“回龙门”的意思是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“扔下包袱”是句漂亮话，一个人扔下的，总得有另一个人捡起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是去是留都是一个人的自由，但总要有人去照顾龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话是我说给自己听的，但你要是觉得我在批评你，我也很乐意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有精神说这些废话，我倒是放心了一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王的女儿，不一定是鼠王。但也可以是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者是，一个不一样的“鼠王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，是我自己选的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门有贫民区，但是不该有贫民区。这是件困难的事，也是不管多少年过去，都需要有人努力去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时代在向前走，但是不该有人被抛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话从你口中说出来，我可以相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有话直说，怎么连你也会支支吾吾的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天，你有没有见过魏彦吾......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交接完公务，这就离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，我得对魏兄道谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这又从何说起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏兄的确相信了玉门一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也相信了，我的一些朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"事情已经结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然受了些损失，但事态还在掌控之内。已经是不幸中的万幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是，我看到了，不管多少年过去，这里的人们还是能团结一心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门还是那个玉门。“人定胜天”，不是虚言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，我也能放心离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次告别，就真的不知何时才能再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"前路山长水远，宗师珍重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庙堂风云诡谲，魏公也该当心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师的提醒，我会放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......突然想起，宗师昨天评价过陈的剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"“炉火纯青，但不算登峰造极。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是这样讲过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"陈在剑术上有天赋，但毕竟修炼赤霄剑法的时日不算久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄剑法的精髓，她还没有得到要领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来魏公是要露一手武功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"之前向宗师提起过，云裂之剑，并非赤霄剑法的最后一式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"以指为剑。\n没有剑气激荡，却隐隐有风，杯中茶水泛起涟漪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄的最后一式，名为天瞠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剑意如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天瞠之剑，当绝则绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"心法如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不破不立，破而后立。云裂之后，方能见苍穹怒目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不除心间迷障，不能领会剑意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"关隘如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剑随心动，招出无悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若一念回首，则剑失锋芒，反害其身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"再会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人离席，风还飘荡了许久。\n男人盯着茶杯中的水纹沉思良久，终于露出一丝笑意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来世上还有这样的剑法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"见过太傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可清楚，你们擅入玉门，已大有违逆之嫌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公遭遇刺杀，又被困在玉门城中，而玉门驶向京城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"属下牵挂魏公安危。事出突然，容不得我们权衡得失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公知遇之恩，属下唯有以性命相报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾是不是吩咐你们，如果三日内，他没有回到龙门，就让你们来玉门找他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅明鉴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可以告诉你们，魏彦吾的遇刺还有玉门遭受的危机，都是意外之事。你们不用多虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"属下已经清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾发生时，你们在何处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"暗中协助城中军民清剿逆党，无人察觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总算你们做了件应该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你们可以走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......太傅不治属下的罪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在禁军的名簿上，你们已经是死人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今日我从未见过你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅都已经知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始便知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也从来没有打算瞒着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅该责怪我越俎代庖了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此次事态没有失控，离不开你从龙门带来的那位年轻特使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这次玉门的动乱，太尉很快就会得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只怕不是“很快”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......这正是我要来玉门的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"对岁兽的态度，是战是和，怎样才是最优解，到现在也难有定论。所有人身在局中，很难看清全盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只怕有些局中人的心思，已经不在寻找那个正确答案上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有意帮平祟侯铲除乱党，是出于对炎国的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你还记得自己的职责，就不用我来教你该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅曾经的教诲，从来不敢忘怀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确是个很好的学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，你与你胞弟儿时一同在我门下读书，你总是学得更快的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受了伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挂了点彩，不碍事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听几位土木天师提起，护住沙渠，多亏了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜让那人跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我是来向你告别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后不用跟在你身边，我也要找一个能让这把剑发挥作用的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你的话，想必不难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间没有仇恨了，但我没有放下超过你的念头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我觉得自己剑术练成的时候，依然会来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是那句话，等你做好了准备，随时可以来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后会有期。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不觉得遗憾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么遗憾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一哪天，祂一场大梦做罢，你我都化为虚无。留她一个人，要向何处求索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在这个年纪，就已经能放下“仇恨”的执念，将来我消失不见，她把对我的记忆都一并忘记，便又放下一层执念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她在武学这条路上，前途岂不是不可限量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传武授业，毕竟你是“宗师”，我说不过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这次令妹在瓮城之上独退天灾，如此神采，恐怕又要留下一段传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没印象，只记得当时喝醉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒醒提壶去，沧桑入诗篇。此间事了，大哥接下来要去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去年和夕待的地方看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观棋的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，那边那人，自己和自己下棋，下了一个下午了。也不说话，也不邀请别人对弈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观棋的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那棋路招法的确精妙，但棋风刁钻诡异，有几步我也看得稀里糊涂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观棋的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是哪位没听过名字的大国手？可怎么会来玉门这种地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"街边的棋馆门外，一人独自面对着棋盘。并不是在打谱，他每落一子，都要沉思许久，似是在苦苦与自己为敌。\n粗糙的木制棋盘上，黑白石子纵横交错，数块棋子彼此缠斗不休，观棋者一时目眩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"棋客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您也会下棋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"略懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"棋客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那这盘残局，你觉得局势怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出，棋盘上三处战斗均已告一段落，局面大抵两分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是白棋中央势力宽广，全局又无孤棋。这样下去，黑棋以半目之差落败，似乎是不可避免......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"棋客？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再仔细算算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"棋客？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我教过你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"角上，留有一劫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......粘劫收后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"白棋势广，执棋者的后顾之忧就更多......我的劫材，也就更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棋局还未尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是不会放弃的。这盘棋，你一定要分个胜负。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"棋局无趣，要分胜负的，是我与我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的那把剑，让我学到了一些事情。这一盘残局，就当作给你的回礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜到了，在我身边肯定有你布下的棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是没有想到，早在那时起，你就对人类，失去了希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人兽有别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你将自己封印入剑，换来一副人的身体。你将自己当作他们中的一个，可最终，你又得到了什么下场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"故友散尽，孤身远走。无人信任，无人知晓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你并非不懂人心，不，你太懂了。千百年来，你一直是与他们接触最深的那个，你怎么会不懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正是因为你深知人心难测，你才无法融入其中。你始终是异类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"颉消失后，这些年你做的这一切，也不过是为了给自己找一个能说上话的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们都寂寞太久了，总想找人说说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们争斗多年，竟然成了最了解彼此的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的敌人，从来都不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有将你当作敌人......哪怕当年，阻止我的，是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的棋局会牵扯更多人，我还是会阻止你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你当然会，前提是，你能看见全局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们还会再见的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保重，兄长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"重岳拾起一颗白子，落在棋盘一角。\n“啪”。\n正招本手，不偏不倚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本书是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年前，老师便想要撰写这本《武典》。只是为玉门戍边，事务繁忙，一直耽搁着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，经他口述，终于由我开始代为执笔整理，昨日方才完稿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中记录了老师对于天下武学的观察和感悟，源流演化，宗法万千，尽在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师让我将这本书送与将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《武典》正篇之外，另附了一套功法，老师说拳脚形意，与病理相通，勤加练习，或许对您的身体有帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半个时辰前，已经离开玉门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师说，“那个客人”他已经送走，将军可以安心处理灾后事务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就不来告别了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为何没随他同去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十岁那年，我被老师从那场劫难中救下，便跟在老师身边，长大后替他记录武功，随他见识各种英雄人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师说，我若志在武学，这十多年听到的，记下的，悟到的，继续钻研，已经足以立身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我若志不在此，《武典》已成，就该去找些自己喜欢的事情做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“人生当行长路。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他这一生，总是这样。"},{"type":"narration","text":"恣意的相逢越多，不得贪恋的纠葛也就越多。\n人重于器，兽悯于情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，军令传达完毕，救灾工作已经展开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......日落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，望烽节......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天是最后一天，但为了备战天灾，军中暂停了烽火传鼓的仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，是否要继续？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"narration","text":"两鬓斑白的将军望向城外，大漠茫茫，什么都看不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今日，我亲自击鼓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，您镇守在城楼一整天了，还是去休息吧，我们来就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关山路远，总得有人为他送行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几行归塞尽，念尔独何之？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"鼓声响了起来。\n沉闷、清晰、悠远。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"十七通鼓，象征着过去一年里玉门经历过的大小劫难。\n天灾刚刚过去，风暴过境，天空中所有杂乱的颜色也被卷走。\n云霞被落日烫红，半天飞锦。\n他就这么走着，脚印一点点被风沙抹平，偌大的玉门城在他身后，也一点点地小了下去。\n咚——\n第十八声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"他蓦地停下了脚步，但没有回头。\n第十八声鼓，象征着玉门刚刚安然渡过的又一场天灾。\n以及......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>云晞万象，</i>\n<i>\n烟荡孤径，</i>\n<i>\n挹罢河汉共伶仃。</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于逃出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏你提前打探清楚了巡防营的活动规律，不然我们也得折在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚收到谛兽的传信，头领他们已经动身前往下一站，我们赶紧去跟大家会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咬牙切齿）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门啊玉门，下一次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你看那边那个人，是不是几次坏了我们好事的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟踪我们？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟踪？我只是离开玉门，在这里歇歇脚而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过偏偏又遇上了你们，也是有缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇静的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的山海众成员 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，送你们上路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再上路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
